VERSION 2
RULE baseline.c.core.risky_memory_allocation_malloc_and_related_functions VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "^[^*/]*\\b(malloc|calloc|realloc)\\s*\\(" "im"
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "user_input|argv|getenv|scanf|fgets|recv\\s*\\(|read\\s*\\(|atoi|atol|strtol|strtoul|input|request|len\\s*\\*|size\\s*\\*" "im"
REPORT "Risky Memory Allocation: malloc() and Related Functions"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
